# tests/ bucket ownership

## Buckets

- `unit/` — command/query business rules with FakeUoW + FakeRepo; never mock SQLAlchemy `Session` or the DB driver
- `integration/` — real Postgres + `SqlAlchemyUnitOfWork` / repositories; prove persistence and constraints
- `functional/` — `TestClient` against the app; status codes and JSON only; no Session in tests

## Rules

- Prefer FakeUoW over patching `SessionFactory`
- Flat modules by concern under each bucket; no per-domain test packages
- Shared fixtures in root `conftest.py`; tiny pure helpers in `helpers.py`
